{"title":"Cardio HTA 2º-2017","guid":"","filepath":"/Users/criaah/Vault/📚 Resources/Mapas-Mentales/Apuntes-de-Clases/Cardiogeriatria-Curso-2025/08 - Escenarios donde aplicar la Prehabilitacion (Barrenechea).smmx","root":{"id":"0","parent":"-1","text":"## Definición","guid":"TsgppAiqQdqAU14KNiOdoQ","children":[{"id":"1","parent":"0","text":"Prehabilitación = intervenciones multimodales pre-operatorias","guid":"l3wvZ5lcSc6Xhl1Z--utzw","children":[{"id":"2","parent":"1","text":"Ventana: decisión Qx → cirugía (típicamente 4-8 sem)","guid":"XQsVB0FIT3G6Hr3GQdT82g","children":[]},{"id":"3","parent":"1","text":"Objetivo: ↑ reserva fisiológica → ↓ complicaciones post-Qx","guid":"fNFKySFkQCikH246R1AxCg","children":[]},{"id":"4","parent":"1","text":"4 pilares simultáneos: ejercicio + nutrición + médico + psicológico","guid":"Jv3-5he4Rfu8eCjG927qeQ","children":[]},{"id":"5","parent":"1","text":"Diferencia con rehab clásica:","guid":"_c2I0mGkTkioPX76sojUog","children":[{"id":"6","parent":"5","text":"Timing → antes vs. después del evento","guid":"U5aUFtdxTl-ue8Ccu7wLxg","children":[]},{"id":"7","parent":"5","text":"Meta → aumentar reserva basal vs. recuperar lo perdido","guid":"fYfsS6Z1TD-leJGEhjXQAQ","children":[]},{"id":"8","parent":"5","text":"Población → Qx electiva vs. post-evento agudo","guid":"22CX27JTTRWlpkwu6AACSQ","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"9","parent":"0","text":"Por qué el AM cardiópata se deteriora durante la espera","guid":"WzX9XSWxTiq96z1gjmRxOQ","children":[{"id":"10","parent":"9","text":"Deconditioning por inactividad","guid":"Ulf2kJvhS4azHxRlx5XiRw","children":[{"id":"11","parent":"10","text":"↓ 1-3% masa muscular por semana de reposo","guid":"eXe6M0dDTxKmq83OmWkRww","children":[]},{"id":"12","parent":"10","text":"↓ VO₂máx ~10% por semana","guid":"CtYb_lPISS28hlk-g0KNSw","children":[]}]},{"id":"13","parent":"9","text":"Sarcopenia inflamatoria acelerada","guid":"ZBxDydGXQQGTi5TdnE18IQ","children":[{"id":"14","parent":"13","text":"Cardiopatía descompensada → IL-6, TNF-α ↑","guid":"FotqMw42SiOkNxEjlRFXyQ","children":[]},{"id":"15","parent":"13","text":"Ansiedad pre-Qx → cortisol → catabolismo","guid":"VC0iD3lBR3KS8g6EwsEKew","children":[]}]},{"id":"16","parent":"9","text":"Empeoramiento de comorbilidades","guid":"jx6EHfayQ-WTR5S01Tkfaw","children":[{"id":"17","parent":"16","text":"HTA mal controlada","guid":"8wKwHq_IRL2ln-qYVsPPXA","children":[]},{"id":"18","parent":"16","text":"DM2 desestabilizada","guid":"63B8TjsRQSuSFfGc9obQRQ","children":[]},{"id":"19","parent":"16","text":"Anemia no corregida","guid":"C0rAm5IMTbSwXFdkYaz4HA","children":[]}]},{"id":"20","parent":"9","text":"Estrés psicológico → peor recuperación post","guid":"LhqvrPnpTTaABjzIlcpTHg","children":[]},{"id":"21","parent":"9","text":"Riesgo de delirium post-Qx ↑ (baja reserva cognitiva, polifarmacia)","guid":"Z0C3MsyxRomhunu49IH1pg","children":[]}]},{"id":"22","parent":"0","text":"Resultado sin intervención: paciente llega PEOR a Qx que en decisión","guid":"i2Bt2ivcQa-CMCp_CJDBuQ","children":[]},{"id":"23","parent":"0","text":"Prehab → revertir esta trayectoria","guid":"B6k89xYGTVGjhMTdChRldg","children":[]},{"id":"24","parent":"0","text":"Curva METs ↔ mortalidad — Kokkinos, Circulation 2010 (slide 1)","guid":"WGHyfuXfSyuIM5ILz3op6Q","children":[{"id":"25","parent":"24","text":"n=15,660; test cardiopulmonar","guid":"aVEG3iUUR8CiHFgQH7_DeQ","children":[]},{"id":"26","parent":"24","text":"≤2 METs → RR 1.00 (referencia)","guid":"uWWvi0iVRFCJXNnG-6RcHA","children":[]},{"id":"27","parent":"24","text":"4.1-6 METs → RR 0.80 (* p<0.001 — primer escalón significativo)","guid":"Wf-Bj-ysRei1Gg6XCKbKbQ","children":[]},{"id":"28","parent":"24","text":"6.1-8 → RR 0.57","guid":"ldoa_tv5Sp27b7cvSX5sLQ","children":[]},{"id":"29","parent":"24","text":"8.1-10 → RR 0.46","guid":"aq0u-6OHTpaf78kULzS-jg","children":[]},{"id":"30","parent":"24","text":">10 METs → asíntota ~0.27-0.33","guid":"_Sq5Pe61TeS7EbfwyBEeCQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"31","parent":"0","text":"Misma curva por sexo — JACC 2022 (slide 2)","guid":"8FSxBv_RToGdN7P7VqMgSw","children":[{"id":"32","parent":"31","text":"Hombres: 4.7±1.5 MET RR 1.00 → 14.3 MET HR 0.24","guid":"pl8jzXFiQ9a5ouN4YhysoA","children":[]},{"id":"33","parent":"31","text":"Mujeres: 5.0±1.3 MET RR 1.00 → 13.9 MET HR 0.23","guid":"eVai8xFTROq5Tr0rOJAyTg","children":[]},{"id":"34","parent":"31","text":"Conclusión: aplicar igual en ambos sexos","guid":"mGe1XexgQUKBTKiUgtjVCA","children":[]}]},{"id":"35","parent":"0","text":"Step count pre-Qx ↔ LOS — Br J Surg Open (slide 4)","guid":"mfiZ_wgETIOqLWkC9GQHzw","children":[{"id":"36","parent":"35","text":"Cirugía colorrectal AM","guid":"bBCZ-IUFTcKEGhBvCSVhqw","children":[]},{"id":"37","parent":"35","text":"↓ pasos diarios → ↑ LOS post-Qx (r=-0.336, p=0.002)","guid":"Iyu1E-GoThmo5_MkV3Esmw","children":[]},{"id":"38","parent":"35","text":"Punto corte sugerido: <5,000 pasos/día = alto riesgo","guid":"ju4gliCLRcuFkHptTHlX1g","children":[]},{"id":"39","parent":"35","text":"Meta prehab: 7,500-10,000 pasos/día","guid":"Zu82AKtTSQ-AIww9nmaPsA","children":[]}]},{"id":"40","parent":"0","text":"Primer cambio significativo: 2-4 meses entrenamiento","guid":"WSfNa4r1RQiVF_n2o2PrBg","children":[{"id":"41","parent":"40","text":"Programas <2 sem → limitado efecto en VO₂máx","guid":"Zq2dS3TRQ-qyUrp6EHsIpg","children":[]},{"id":"42","parent":"40","text":"Mínimo 4 sem; óptimo 6-8 sem","guid":"pwLy9oxaTcGUsjjgL45uyw","children":[]}]},{"id":"43","parent":"0","text":"FRCV potencian mortalidad a iguales METs","guid":"8xXmrvfTSEq2wmSMsuku8Q","children":[{"id":"44","parent":"43","text":"Implica: prehab debe SIMULTÁNEAMENTE ↑ METs + ↓ FRCV","guid":"9y2yQFhwQ1SYOjx3jb41lw","children":[]}]},{"id":"45","parent":"0","text":"Cirugía cardíaca electiva (RVA, RVM, CABG)","guid":"KQZpY1F3TbqAd-b4vwXC9g","children":[{"id":"46","parent":"45","text":"Ventana: 4-8 sem","guid":"3LWLlOk9S7OxiZA3fm-FCQ","children":[]},{"id":"47","parent":"45","text":"Evidencia: PREHAB trial (Steinmetz, Anaesthesia 2020)","gu