ermera","guid":"PsCOtjP9QzG1QMOe-abX4w","children":[]}]},{"id":"189","parent":"180","text":"Educación grupal (no individual) componentes nutrición + psicoeducación","guid":"28e1QUYRTo6ulhJp1t6bRQ","children":[]},{"id":"190","parent":"180","text":"Telerehabilitación post-pandemia (infrautilizada)","guid":"eva-l7n9S6SdECE7A8EMDw","children":[]},{"id":"191","parent":"180","text":"Articulación APS → CESFAM para continuidad ejercicio","guid":"tuXu5XEDSmqPLJJGhc1A4g","children":[]}]},{"id":"192","parent":"0","text":"ROI positivo","guid":"AyM-p1JqTkq4O5qligDjtg","children":[{"id":"193","parent":"192","text":"Costo programa: US$300-1,500/paciente","guid":"RXOc_gXLT0a1POBLiX4jOQ","children":[]},{"id":"194","parent":"192","text":"Ahorro hospitalario: US$500-3,000/paciente","guid":"ataCQg-aSyKFeYIG3YTNpA","children":[]},{"id":"195","parent":"192","text":"Menor LOS + menos reingresos","guid":"tmkeaOCxQIGZNw_ZmsXe2w","children":[]}]},{"id":"196","parent":"0","text":"Tamizar AM con cirugía electiva pendiente","guid":"73nSI0-nRbS9NyTIKi75Tg","children":[{"id":"197","parent":"196","text":"Preguntar activamente en VGI","guid":"kEYE8X8yQwuVHqHzHa0ghw","children":[]}]},{"id":"198","parent":"0","text":"Aplicar CFS + Timed Up & Go + 6MWT (o sit-to-stand)","guid":"ON4Qux8ETY-BDF68TXGM5g","children":[]},{"id":"199","parent":"0","text":"Derivar kinesiología si CFS ≥4 + Qx en >4 sem","guid":"jLiMIqDgTj-iGMMnxdG7NQ","children":[]},{"id":"200","parent":"0","text":"Optimizar médicamente","guid":"v4EO2-aNQtG0cSJFlHkXKg","children":[{"id":"201","parent":"200","text":"Revisar GDMT IC, BP, glicemia, anemia","guid":"PbkE1y3OQaqckPVCAY7q8g","children":[]},{"id":"202","parent":"200","text":"Polifarmacia (deprescribing BZD/anticolinérgicos)","guid":"7fszZCQ_TBC-zpe_8LJaGw","children":[]}]},{"id":"203","parent":"0","text":"Sugerir suplementación proteica (1.2-1.5 g/kg)","guid":"l9yJ-vaHSC2uqWR-fd8HmA","children":[{"id":"204","parent":"203","text":"Derivar nutricionista si MNA-SF <12","guid":"HakgV3JOQ9GCs2NUTBacXw","children":[]}]},{"id":"205","parent":"0","text":"Educar paciente y familia (empoderar)","guid":"b_5L4AAJRuOF9aNms-GeOA","children":[]},{"id":"206","parent":"0","text":"Prescribir podómetro + meta pasos si recursos limitados","guid":"ioK0eqgjTHiyzxFojHnIzA","children":[]},{"id":"207","parent":"0","text":"Coordinar con cirujano","guid":"B3wWJpdKTZW6z7__4f71Fw","children":[{"id":"208","parent":"207","text":"Documentar CFS + 6MWT + plan prehab en interconsulta","guid":"aSca_GDdRgenjkri1RYgpA","children":[]},{"id":"209","parent":"207","text":"Sugerir timing apropiado","guid":"PCOilYRNRQGbFw3fw0I_gw","children":[]}]},{"id":"210","parent":"0","text":"1. La ventana pre-Qx es TERAPÉUTICA, no pasiva","guid":"5Rd8yb9mRFKx2NZ1AbE38Q","children":[{"id":"211","parent":"210","text":"Cambiar chip del equipo quirúrgico = primera intervención","guid":"RFwHvqkpQFSXFeNB1X1KJg","children":[]}]},{"id":"212","parent":"0","text":"2. METs como argumento para diferir","guid":"q6LsZv8kT22yDQUHzjvdXw","children":[{"id":"213","parent":"212","text":"<4 METs → riesgo alto","guid":"NKi2aggwRdWT-vn8lTvz5g","children":[]},{"id":"214","parent":"212","text":"Subir a 6-8 METs en 8 sem → ↓ 30% riesgo","guid":"TLTiy8ibRRa7HEBNxNBvBg","children":[]},{"id":"215","parent":"212","text":"Robusto para diferir Qx electiva no urgente","guid":"KZN8-NM0SFWsaVbO1pxAoQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"216","parent":"0","text":"3. Step count: el biomarcador del pobre","guid":"azYfw5WiT7S8KYJQ3n-2XQ","children":[{"id":"217","parent":"216","text":"Predice LOS post-Qx","guid":"jkPBJMsJSAOWC36M_cqKlw","children":[]},{"id":"218","parent":"216","text":"Costo casi cero (podómetro o celular)","guid":"Gc8piiTvQEWulBQDVlpRYg","children":[]}]},{"id":"219","parent":"0","text":"4. Mínimo 4 semanas","guid":"IBttWNZgTOqJJrgrG4ZuNg","children":[{"id":"220","parent":"219","text":"<2 sem → no cambia VO₂máx","guid":"51lgT79pQkyCj0q3LUEAbg","children":[]},{"id":"221","parent":"219","text":"Si <2 sem → priorizar nutrición + tabaco + médico","guid":"yUvtv2-YSFi9xHIPQX3B5w","children":[]}]},{"id":"222","parent":"0","text":"5. Multimodalidad OBLIGATORIA","guid":"-dE9NStNRDyD94unZy22qA","children":[{"id":"223","parent":"222","text":"\"Ejercicio solo\" no es prehab","guid":"DpjZOEk7QnG295Vr_ppQcg","children":[]},{"id":"224","parent":"222","text":"Los 4 componentes son sinérgicos","guid":"rL1nTFKMRvaEcqRaZI8BbQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"225","parent":"0","text":"6. Cesación tabáquica: 4-8 sem","guid":"Mtmh0c7FQR2M-dtRzUcvdA","children":[{"id":"226","parent":"225","text":"↓ 40% complicaciones pulmonares","guid":"sxeh74ZzTl--SGu-Lf3K8Q","children":[]},{"id":"227","parent":"225","text":"<2 sem → paradoja (↑ secreciones)","guid":"yGxR-A7WSk2czQDv9oiagQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"228","parent":"0","text":"7. EMI training: la joya escondida","guid":"HqbmsGxCSvmvRKCdKCrxSQ","children":[{"id":"229","parent":"228","text":"Incentivador o EMI device, 30-50% PIM diario","guid":"YDjLkG4CTiuSN6y_DbugJg","children":[]},{"id":"230","parent":"228","text":"↓ complicaciones pulmonares post-Qx torácica/cardíaca","guid":"FmZTByqjS1mUa_LZ60voOQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"231","parent":"0","text":"8. Educación = adherencia post-Qx","guid":"fe_yKWW3SrunL04FLCj3mA","children":[{"id":"232","parent":"231","text":"Paciente prehabilitado llega con \"chip puesto\"","guid":"i7A875AtS-KyYHSUOBsl0A","children":[]},{"id":"233","parent":"231","text":"Mayor adherencia a rehab post-Qx","guid":"vhPCGDdYTHa16-7wvzgtuA","children":[]}]},{"id":"234","parent":"0","text":"9. Selección de pacientes","guid":"T9GaOvu4TsKRXfJ3_HObzg","children":[{"id":"235","parent":"234","text":"CFS ≥4 → mayor beneficio","guid":"Qo-vB3oySWyvDyVXw_UOUg","children":[]},{"id":"236","parent":"234","text":"CFS 1-3 → considerar, pero ganancia menor","guid":"qobRzIn4RgCnQopQt-U0_w","children":[]},{"id":"237","parent":"234","text":"CFS ≥7 (muy frágil) → evidencia limitada, evaluar caso a caso","guid":"JnVgZTp3SSCBivGkyO5Scw","children":[]}]},{"id":"238","parent":"0","text